Nine findings in the `23a86045..06f08092` diff, most severe first. I found these by reading the source only: no tests or checks were run and nothing was verified. Findings 1 to 5 can produce an expansion the checker would disagree with, which breaks the "exact or declined" invariant. Findings 6 to 9 are lost recall and cleanup.

